व पार्श्वनाथ स्तवन\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"श्री १०८ नाम पार्श्वनाथ स्तवन\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"श्री पार्श्वनाथ सांख्या स्तवन\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"श्री पार्श्वनाथ चैत्य पारिपाटी\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"श्री पार्श्वनाथ नाममाला\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"135 नाम गर्भित श्री पार्श्वनाथ स्तवन\\\\\\\" में, \\\\\\\"108 नाम गर्भित श्री पार्श्वनाथ स्तवन\\\\\\\" आदि में किया गया है। मुंबई के सांताक्रूज के मंदिर में, श्री कालिकुंड पार्श्वनाथ में, लोढ़न पार्श्वनाथ की मूर्ति है।\\\"}]\\n28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"स्तुति: कच्चे सूती धागे से कुए मेसे प्रगट हुए, बालुना प्रभु लोहसमान जो बन गये, पद्मासन से शोभते दर्भावतीमा राजता। \\\\\\\"श्री लोढ़न पार्श्व ने भावे करूं हुं वंदना\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"जाप मंत्र: \\\\\\\"ॐ ह्री अर्हम् श्री लोढ़न पार्श्वनाथय नमः\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"ट्रस्ट: सेठ श्री देवचंदजी धरमचंद्रजी पेढ़ी, श्री लोढ़न पार्श्वनाथ श्वेतांबर जैन तीर्थ, श्रीमाली वागा शामलाजी नी शेरी में (दरभावती), मु.पो.: डभोई-391 110, जिला: वडोदरा, गुजरात राज्य, भारत। फोन: 02663-2258150, मोबाइल: 09426375123\\\"}]\\n2c:T7a8,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"Second and third incarnation of Lord Parshvanath: Second incarnation Yuthapati Gaj - Due to the meditation of Marubhuti, after completion of his life, the creature of Marubhuti was born as Yuthapati Gajraj, the lord of elephants in the Vindhyachal mountain range. Kamath's wife Varuna died and became Yuthapati Gajraj's favorite elephant. On the other hand, when the king received the news of the murder of his brother Marubhuti by Kamath, he became disillusioned with this selfish world and the king took the initiation of a monk and took sobriety and went to the Vindhyachal mountain range and started doing excellent meditation. One day when the king (sage) was standing in meditation posture in this Vindhyachal mountain range, at that time the creature of Marubhuti in the form of Gajraj came there and seeing the sage in meditation posture, Marubhuti got the knowledge of caste remembrance. Remembering his previous birth in caste remembrance, Gajraj accepted the Shravak religion from the sage. Once there was a terrible fire in the forests of Vindhyachal in which the entire forest started burning, at that time Gajraj stood in the water of a lake to save his life. At the same time, the creature of Kamath, which after dying had become a snake of Kurkat race, while passing through the sky, his sight fell on Gajraj standing in the lake; As soon as his sight fell on Gajraj, the Kurkat snake, a creature of Kamath, got enmity and out of anger, it stung the elephant's head (forehead). Due to the poison of the sting, Gajraj's entire body became strange, but Gajraj endured the pain with equanimity and completed his life with equanimity (Second Bhava). Third Bhava Sahasrara Dev - After taking a pledge to follow Shravak Dharma and living with equanimity and completing his life, a god named Sahastrar was born in the eighth world of the desert (third Bhava). This idol is known as Sthal 08- Shri Lodhan Parshvanath Prabhu Temple, Dabhoi (Darbhavati).\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$2c\\\"}]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rscData":"","segmentData":{"/_tree":"","/_full":"","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug":"","/$d$lang/tirtha":"","/$d$lang":"","/_index":"","/_head":""},"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/[lang]/tirtha/[slug]/page,_N_T_/en/tirtha/tirtha-011"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/$d$lang/tirtha/$d$slug","/$d$lang/tirtha","/$d$lang","/_index","/_head"],"revalidate":60,"cacheControl":{"revalidate":60,"expire":31536000}}}